    "turn_text": "or other. We often think about those in terms of our children growing up at important milestones. But today, I want to consider the opposites of those sentiments that aren't ever shared in hashtags or social media posts. but are shared in heartfelt, difficult conversations. And those are the thoughts of when will this be over? Will I make it through this? How long will this be difficult? And so on, those kind of feelings. I'm sad to say that in the past couple of weeks, I have had some very heavy and difficult conversations with some people. And some of the major topics discussed have been divorce, death, pornography, homosexuality, unemployment, infidelity, and depression. And in addition to those, there's those subjects that people in my life or surrounding circles are dealing with. There are the difficult circumstances of teenagers making poor choices, financial struggles, marital strife, all challenging issues.",
